# Cross-origin isolation for the multithreaded (pthreads + OffscreenCanvas)
# Thermion WASM build, which needs SharedArrayBuffer. Cloudflare Pages serves
# this file's rules as response headers. GitHub Pages / docs.page cannot set
# these, which is why the gallery is hosted here rather than with the docs.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
  Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: cross-origin
